{"no":6,"title":"Percy Buttons","titleZh":"珀西·巴顿斯","audio":"audio/L06.mp3","duration":77.07,"question":{"en":"Who is Percy Buttons?","zh":"珀西·巴顿斯是谁？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":13.15,"t2":18.39,"en":"Who is Percy Buttons?","zh":"珀西·巴顿斯是谁？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":18.39,"t2":23.38,"en":"I have just moved to a house in Bridge Street.","zh":"我刚刚搬进了大桥街的一所房子。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"have just moved","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to a house in Bridge Street","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in Bridge Street","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a house","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["现在完成时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":2,"t":23.38,"t2":27.38,"en":"Yesterday a beggar knocked at my door.","zh":"昨天一个乞丐来敲我的门。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Yesterday knocked","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at my door","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a beggar","g":"冠词+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"my door","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":3,"t":27.38,"t2":32.04,"en":"He asked me for a meal and a glass of beer.","zh":"他向我索要一顿饭和一杯啤酒。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"asked me","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for a meal and a glass of beer","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of beer","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a meal","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":4,"t":32.04,"t2":38.42,"en":"In return for this, the beggar stood on his head and sang songs.","zh":"作为回报，那乞丐头顶地倒立起来，嘴里还唱着歌。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"sang songs","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"In return for this","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"on his head","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for this","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型","并列结构"]},{"i":5,"t":38.42,"t2":40.91,"en":"I gave him a meal.","zh":"我给了他一顿饭。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"gave meal","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a meal","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":6,"t":40.91,"t2":44.7,"en":"He ate the food and drank the beer.","zh":"他把食物吃完，又喝了酒。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"ate food","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"drank beer","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the food","g":"冠